      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;I have always loved hearts,&quot; writes acclaimed actress Drew Barrymore in the foreword to this heartwarming book. &quot;The way that continuous line accomplishes the most extraordinary thing--it conveys love.&quot; Here, Barrymore shares the photographs she has taken of heart-shaped objects and patterns she has come across over the past ten years. Some are obvious and others barely discernible. A very personal collection of images, many of them accompanied by brief captions that reflect on beauty in the everyday</marc:subfield>
